// ============================================================================
// Windows Vista/7 Welcome Center — Windhawk tool-mod
//
// Approach: faithful modern Win32 recreation. Artwork is loaded like the
// Win7 Network Flyout: user files in the Windhawk mod storage folder (or an
// optional custom folder) override embedded Base64 fallbacks. No artwork is
// read from and nothing is written to %SystemRoot%; startup only verifies the
// native control.exe PE signature. Task icons that have no artwork still come
// from the current shell image list (SHGetStockIconInfo).
//
// Undocumented API used (isolated below):
//   ntdll!RtlGetVersion — GetVersionEx/VerifyVersionInfo are compatibility-
//   lied on Windows 10+. RtlGetVersion is the stable way to read the real
//   build. Failure falls back to registry CurrentMajorVersionNumber.
//   shell32!SHGetUserPicturePath (#261) — last-resort copy of the account
//   picture to a temp BMP when the documented registry/folder locations miss.
// ============================================================================

